OL,3,GNEWSAThree teenagers die as car ends up
OL,4,Ain river
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree teenagers in a car which ended up
OL,7,Fin the River Wear have been found dead.
OL,9,FNorthumbria Police said a black Audi A3
OL,10,Fcame off the road at Panns Bank near
OL,11,FWearmouth Bridge, in Sunderland, and
OL,12,Fentered the water just before 13:30
OL,13,FBST.
OL,15,FFour people were in the car at the time
OL,16,Fand a 17-year-old boy managed to reach
OL,17,Fsafety. He is currently in hospital
OL,18,Fwith non-serious injuries, and has
OL,19,Fsubsequently been arrested in
OL,20,Fconnection with the incident, the force
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
